.TH RUSTY-SOLITAIRE 6 "2026" "Rusty Solitaire" "Games"
.SH NAME
rusty-solitaire \- play 91 solitaire card games
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rusty-solitaire
.RB [ \-\-log\-input ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Rusty Solitaire
is a collection of 91 solitaire (patience) card games, including Klondike,
FreeCell, Spider, Golf, Yukon and Scorpion. It is a Rust port of GNOME
AisleRiot and plays every game by AisleRiot's original rules.
.PP
Choose a game with Game \(-> Select Game.
Cards are moved by dragging them, or by clicking them with Click to Move
turned on.
Double-click a card to send it to a foundation, and right-click (or, on a
touch screen, press and hold) a covered card to see it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-log\-input
Record every press, move and release, and every menu action, in
.IR input\-log.txt
in the settings folder, to help diagnose input problems.
The same can be turned on with Help \(-> Record Input Log.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rusty-solitaire/settings.ini
Settings: the last game played, game options, card style and so on.
.SH AUTHOR
Rusty Solitaire was written by the Rusty Solitaire authors, based on GNOME AisleRiot by
Jonathan Blandford, Felix Bellaby, Rosanna Yuen, Callum McKenzie, Vincent Povirk
and many others.
